#
# The lines sim/qvirt/console-diff.py leaves out of the NetBSD consoles of
# make netbsd-qvirt and its reference (doc/qvirt.md): what depends on how
# much virtual time has passed, which the two processors spend differently.
# /etc/rc's `date`, at the start and the end of the boot:
^(Mon|Tue|Wed|Thu|Fri|Sat|Sun) (Jan|Feb|Mar|Apr|May|Jun|Jul|Aug|Sep|Oct|Nov|Dec) [ 0-9][0-9] [0-9:]{8} UTC [0-9]{4}$
# syslogd's messages to the console (login's ROOT LOGIN): stamped, and
# written by another process at its own pace.
^(Jan|Feb|Mar|Apr|May|Jun|Jul|Aug|Sep|Oct|Nov|Dec) [ 0-9][0-9] [0-9:]{8} rdqvirt 
